# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=libinput
pkgver=1.28.1
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="Input devices for Wayland compositors: keyboards, mice, touchpads (gestures too)"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/libinput/"
license=(MIT)
depends=(glibc systemd mtdev libevdev)
source=("https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/libinput/libinput/-/archive/$pkgver/libinput-$pkgver.tar.gz")
sha256sums=('a13f8c9a7d93df3c85c66afd135f0296701d8d32f911991b7aa4273fdd6a42a3')

build() {
    # no libwacom (tablet details) or debug GUI (GTK) yet
    meson setup libinput-$pkgver build --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release \
        -D libwacom=false -D debug-gui=false -D tests=false -D documentation=false
    ninja -C build
}

package() {
    DESTDIR="$pkgdir" ninja -C build install
}
